              "Identifiers, buffers, and closures must be managed defensively to prevent unintended memory retention in the V8 heap.",
              "Asynchronous boundaries must always be bounded with explicit timeouts and structured error handling.",
              "Monitoring event loop lag and heap allocations provides instant visibility into operational bottlenecks."
